<title>USA: REDBOOK RESEARCH CHANGES INDEX NAME, RELEASE TIME.</title>
<headline>REDBOOK RESEARCH CHANGES INDEX NAME, RELEASE TIME.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lynch, Jones &amp; Ryan Inc said its Redbook Retail Sales Index will be renamed the Redbook Retail Average effective Tuesday, August 19.</p>
<p>In addition, Redbook said its new release time for the news media has been changed to 1440 EDT/1840 GMT from 1455 EDT/1855 GMT also beginning August 19.</p>
<p>Paying customers can expect to receive their Redbook Retail Average via fax 15 minutes earlier at 1405 EDT/1805 GMT. Redbook said the time switch was to avoid conflicts with similarly timed releases from the Federal Reserve, following Federal Open Market Committee meetings.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
